---
# Check groups: bugprone, cert, performance, readability.
# Disabled checks, each with its reason:
#   readability-magic-numbers             noisy in tests and protocol tables; revisit Thursday
#   readability-identifier-length         short loop and lambda names are fine
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters  flags most two-argument functions
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '(lib|app)/.*'
FormatStyle: file
...

---
# Static analysis policy for the product code (lib/ and app/).
#
# Check groups: bugprone, cert, performance, readability.
# Every finding is an error: the 'tidy' target fails and CI blocks the merge.
#
# Checks disabled for the whole project, each with its reason:
# readability-magic-numbers noisy in protocol tables; revisit with CAN/Modbus
# readability-identifier-length short loop and lambda names are fine
# bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters flags most two-argument functions
#
# A single finding that is wrong for one line is suppressed on that line, never
# here, with the reason in a comment directly above:
# // <why this code is right>
# // NOLINTNEXTLINE(check-name)
# Current line suppressions (keep this list in step with the code):
# lib/src/StateMachine.cpp readability-use-anyofallof lookup loop has a side effect
Checks: >
-*,
bugprone-*,
cert-*,
performance-*,
readability-*,
-readability-magic-numbers,
-readability-identifier-length,
-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '(lib|app)/.*'
FormatStyle: file
...